# Keep GitHub updated

After finishing a meaningful change in this repo, commit and push to `origin/main` without waiting to be asked.

- Never commit `.env` or secrets
- Author must remain the human git identity (not Cursor)
- If `.git/config` / `origin` is missing, restore `https://github.com/amirshahzadhashmi7145/ops-agent.git` then push
- Skip empty commits; push only when there is something to ship
